  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一个 KNODD 克诺德 垃圾桶倒置，喷上了金色的涂漆，饰有一个醒目的黑色闪电图案。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20312251"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bc/ce/bcce7d1a7c55d9cd0c7d269639769dfa.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bc/ce/bcce7d1a7c55d9cd0c7d269639769dfa.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.用颜料和 KNODD 克诺德 打造摇滚乐器。</strong>用一些涂漆用胶带和喷漆，打造巧妙设计，然后把垃圾桶翻过来，让你的孩子自由肆意地去玩他们全新的打击乐器吧。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "灰色的 KNODD 克诺德 垃圾桶里装有几卷包装纸，桶身底部缠绕着细绳，上面还挂着装饰带。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20312251",
    "00289510",
    "00348265"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ef/92/ef92a88a34efeb4cf2aac1bcbfd31150.jpg"
